{243}{I'm a gambler, kid, and you don't learn that in a school. I shall permit you to associate with me here at the club. We will throw dice together. If you're smart, you may even learn how to be as good as I am, though I have yet to meet the man to do it. If that day ever comes, you will have acheived the status of master gambler.}{I'm a gambler, kid, and you don't learn that in a school. I shall permit you to associate with me here at the club. We will throw dice together. If you're smart, you may even learn how to be as good as I am, though I have yet to meet the man to do it. If that day ever comes, you will have acheived the status of master gambler.}{}{}{}{qu 1108 1 } 
