{255}{I am smarter than the average person.}{}{13}{}{258}{lc 1 5  } 
{256}{I am quick, which is usually enough.}{}{5}{sk 1 15}{268}{lc 1 6 } 
{258}{Hah!  If I could keep a coin for every time I heard that line. [He sighs.] To be young and innocent again. You are like a babe in the cradle, @pcname@, I am almost going to regret taking your money.}{Hah!  If I could keep a coin for every time I heard that line. [He sighs.] To be young and innocent again. You are like a babe in the cradle, @pcname@, I am almost going to regret taking your money.}{}{}{}{ } 
{259}{Almost as much as I will regret taking yours, I am sure.}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{260}{Lets stop talking and get down to it, sir.}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{263}{Right, everybody thinks they're smarter than the next guy. You may be sharp, but this is a game of guts, not smarts. I have seen all kinds of guys break under the pressure. It has nothing to do with how smart or how dumb you may be, @pcname@.}{Right, everybody thinks they're smarter than the next guy. You may be sharp, but this is a game of guts, not smarts. I have seen all kinds of guys break under the pressure. It has nothing to do with how smart or how dumb you may be, @pcname@.}{}{}{}{ } 
{264}{That will never happen to me.}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{265}{Intellectual talent will prevail, sir.}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{268}{Right, well, if you try anything "quick" in here you'll be found floating in sewers, deceased from "mysterious causes". Do I make myself clear?}{Right, well, if you try anything "quick" in here you'll be found floating in sewers, deceased from "mysterious causes". Do I make myself clear?}{}{}{}{ } 
{269}{Of course, of course. Everything is on the level.}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{270}{I'll pretend I didn't hear that.}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{273}{I have seen every system in the book, kid. If you think that you got a special one, think again. Gambling is about having guts. If you lose your nerve then you lose your money, as simple as that. A system can not give you the nerve you need - either you have them or you don't.}{I have seen every system in the book, kid. If you think that you got a special one, think again. Gambling is about having guts. If you lose your nerve then you lose your money, as simple as that. A system can not give you the nerve you need - either you have them or you don't.}{}{}{}{ } 
{274}{We shall see about that!}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
{275}{Let us put it to the test then, shall we?}{}{5}{}{278}{ } 
